{"id":"n14018-1-6","stage":0,"title":"연세 · 年纪（敬语）","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14018-1-6-1","ko":"올해 아버님의 연세가 어떻게 되시죠?","zh":"您父亲今年多大年纪？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"올해","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올해：今年。","readings":[{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67842","senseId":"1","lemma":"올해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}},{"text":"아버님의","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버님：父亲，爸爸；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"아버님","audio":"/audio/64187c187ea07eb8ba99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71340","senseId":"2","lemma":"아버님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버님의","audio":"/audio/76d85fec37da49dced39.mp3"}},{"text":"연세가","meaning":"年纪（敬语）","explanation":"연세：年龄的敬语，用于尊称长辈的年纪；-가 标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"연세","audio":"/audio/fc2837075a9efa4e8f57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14018","senseId":"1","lemma":"연세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연세가","audio":"/audio/2ffe8e2c201e645f9e1e.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"되시죠?","meaning":"是、为（询问年龄）","explanation":"되다：是、为（询问年龄）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"4","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되시죠","audio":"/audio/c60ee84fb8c9e76bbc1b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8a0cd9bb73fb17e9","term":"올해","zh":"今年","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3","entryId":"67842","definition":"现在正在度过的这一年。","pronunciation":["올해"]},{"id":"64187c187ea07eb8","term":"아버님","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/64187c187ea07eb8ba99.mp3","entryId":"71340","definition":"(尊称)在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的男子。","pronunciation":["아버님"]},{"id":"fc2837075a9efa4e","term":"연세","zh":"年纪（敬语）","audio":"/audio/fc2837075a9efa4e8f57.mp3","entryId":"14018","definition":"对他人年龄的尊称。","pronunciation":["연세"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"是、为（询问年龄）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"是、为（询问年龄）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/28a08187fb1d01e27282.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14018-1-6-2","ko":"올해 예순이십니다.","zh":"今年六十岁。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"올해","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올해：今年。","readings":[{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67842","senseId":"1","lemma":"올해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}},{"text":"예순이십니다.","meaning":"六十","explanation":"예순：六十；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"예순","audio":"/audio/e891d0f2a21e0aa06886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87910","senseId":"1","lemma":"예순","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예순이십니다","audio":"/audio/bc18e4875c0c1643c710.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8a0cd9bb73fb17e9","term":"올해","zh":"今年","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3","entryId":"67842","definition":"现在正在度过的这一年。","pronunciation":["올해"]},{"id":"e891d0f2a21e0aa0","term":"예순","zh":"六十","audio":"/audio/e891d0f2a21e0aa06886.mp3","entryId":"87910","definition":"十的六倍的数目。","pronunciation":["예순"]}],"audio":"/audio/d1ff0ed1756bc2e80fa5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.16,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14018","labe